    description="Assess whether the assistant satisfied every distinct intention the user raised across the conversation. Completeness measures breadth of coverage — whether each separate request, question, or task the user expressed was addressed — not whether a single overarching goal was reached. Enumerates every user intention, marks each satisfied or unsatisfied, and labels the conversation complete only when no active intention was left unaddressed.",
